  1. SQLite Database Integration

  - Added better-sqlite3 to read Cursor's state.vscdb files
  - Reads from: ~/Library/Application Support/Cursor/User/workspaceStorage/<workspace-id>/state.vscdb
  - Dynamically explores database schema (table discovery)
  - Logs table names and row counts for debugging

  2. Improved Extension Code (vscode-extension/src/extension.ts)

  - Added Output channel for debugging: View → Output → "Gitify Prompt"
  - Rewrote hookIntoCursorChat() to watch SQLite databases
  - Added readCursorChatFromDB() function for message extraction
  - Fixed command references (prompt → gitify-prompt)

  3. Documentation (README.md)

  Added "Capture Methods" section comparing:

  Method 1: Claude Code Wrapper (Recommended)
  - ✅ Most reliable - direct access to ~/.claude/projects/*.jsonl
  - ✅ Perfect matching - timestamp + path
  - ✅ Full fidelity - captures pasted content

